{
  "brief": "o3dj-envelope-brief/spike-0",
  "id": "d08-vent-bool",
  "script": "scripts/envelope-spike/corpus/d08-vent-bool.o3j.js",
  "role": "defect",
  "sources": [
    "Seeded envelope defect D08 (a switch that only fails with a small size): a shelled cover with optional vent slots in the long walls. With vents on, a low cover leaves a thin web above the slots, then opens the rim. The range starts at 24 mm, where the opened rim still meets the slot at a knife edge. Original test part for the Open3DJ envelope spike, MIT. Units are mm, Z is up."
  ],
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "Height",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 40,
      "min": 24,
      "max": 60,
      "unit": "mm"
    },
    {
      "name": "Width",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 70,
      "min": 50,
      "max": 100,
      "unit": "mm"
    },
    {
      "name": "Vents",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    }
  ],
  "gates": [
    {
      "targets": [
        "cover"
      ],
      "build": [
        0,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "build_source": "as modelled"
    }
  ],
  "assertions": [
    {
      "id": "builds",
      "kind": "builds"
    },
    {
      "id": "status",
      "kind": "status",
      "in": [
        "ok"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "valid",
      "kind": "valid"
    },
    {
      "id": "one-solid",
      "kind": "count",
      "quantity": "solids",
      "target": "cover",
      "expect": {
        "eq": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gate-watertight",
      "kind": "gate",
      "gate": "watertight",
      "target": "cover"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate-min-wall",
      "kind": "gate",
      "gate": "min_wall",
      "target": "cover"
    }
  ],
  "defect": {
    "fails": [
      "gate-min-wall"
    ],
    "region": "scripts/envelope-spike/corpus/regions.ts REGIONS[\"d08-vent-bool\"]"
  }
}
